--- !u!114 &7427015765888665461
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 5681160626821464208}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d3c53d8ec40a9cf4081d0219df78e083, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Player: {fileID: 0}
  PlayerObjective: {fileID: 0}
  textComponent: {fileID: 4981841201441813837}
  ContinueButton: {fileID: 5477997342781673028}
  SkipButton: {fileID: 2582365773699480589}
  panel: {fileID: 2916174115478540393}
  Merchant: {fileID: 0}
  lines:
  - 'Trader : Well, well, if it isn''t Ottis, the oddball beaver. '
  - 'Player:  Hey there, Benny! '
  - 'Trader:  What brings you to our shores?'
  - 'Player:  I''m looking for my friend.. '
  - 'Trader:  Hm.. not sure I can help you with that'
  - 'Trader:  But there''s a town nearby, on the other island'
  - 'Trader:  Unfortunately, the bridge that used to be here has collapsed'
  - 'Trader:  So you''ll have to rebuild it in order to get there.'
  - 'Trader:  In the mean time, why don''t you have a look at my shop?'
  - 'Player: Hmm ok, what do we have here, Benny?'
  - 'Trader: Allow me to introduce ya to the goods, Ottis! First up, we got these
    succulent apples. A bite of these will put the spring back in your step and patch
    up any bumps and scrapes.'
  - 'Player: (nodding) Ah, apples for health, got it. What else?'
  - 'Trader: (grinning) Now, Ottis, these here are magic nuts. Plant one of ''em
    in the ground, and presto! You''ll have a full-grown tree in no time. Wood from
    these trees can be handy for building bridges between islands. Talk about convenient!'
  - 'Player: (impressed) Building bridges, huh? That could be super helpful! What''s
    the last item?  '
  - "Trader: (with a mischievous grin) Last but not least, the pi\xE8ce de r\xE9sistance
    \u2013 Gold Goblets! Sip from one of these, Ottis, and you'll be zippin' and
    zoomin' around for a short while. Makes traversing tricky terrain a breeze!"
  - 'Ottis: (excited) Gold Goblets for a speed boost? Count me in! How much for one
    of each, Benny?'
  - 'Trader: (rubbing his paws together) Well, Ottis, you''re in luck! The prices
    are right there on the shop poster behind me. You can choose any item you like
    and pay as you wish'
  - "Ottis: (grinning) That's convenient! In that case, I'll take one of each \u2013
    an apple, a nut, and a gold goblet!"
  - 'Ottis: Thanks a bunch, Benny! These items will surely help me on my quest. If
    I need more, I''ll know where to find you!'
  - 'Trader: Anytime, Ottis! Good luck on your adventure, and remember, Benny''s
    shop is always open when you''re in need!'
  textSpeed: 0
  isBoss: 0
